WEBVTT

00:00:00.260 --> 00:00:01.560
Your subscription's posting

00:00:01.560 --> 00:00:03.160
allowance and your optional

00:00:03.160 --> 00:00:05.020
AI credits do different jobs.

00:00:05.270 --> 00:00:06.370
Let's find both.

00:00:06.530 --> 00:00:07.990
If you manage billing,

00:00:08.030 --> 00:00:09.210
click Configuration

00:00:09.210 --> 00:00:11.190
in the sidebar, then Billing.

00:00:11.260 --> 00:00:12.780
Review the plan and current

00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:13.880
terms for your account.

00:00:14.310 --> 00:00:15.450
The Pro plan's current

00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:16.750
allowance is up to fifteen

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:18.610
posts a day.

00:00:19.060 --> 00:00:20.320
Other plans and team

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:21.440
arrangements can differ,

00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:22.700
so use the allowance

00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:24.040
that belongs to your account.

00:00:24.220 --> 00:00:25.620
In Post to Market,

00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:26.960
check the posts remaining

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:28.600
today before choosing a batch.

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:29.760
That remaining

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:31.200
number is not the same

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:32.600
as your AI credit balance.

00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:33.900
AI Background

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:35.340
options show their credit

00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:36.840
cost alongside the choice.

00:00:37.250 --> 00:00:38.610
Leaving the option off

00:00:38.610 --> 00:00:40.010
uses the original photos.

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:41.500
Choosing a treatment

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:43.100
uses the applicable credits.

00:00:43.220 --> 00:00:44.300
A credit pack

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:46.310
adds AI credits; it doesn't

00:00:46.310 --> 00:00:47.750
automatically raise your plan's

00:00:47.750 --> 00:00:48.860
daily posting allowance.

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:50.500
If you want to purchase

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:52.570
credits or change plans, review

00:00:52.570 --> 00:00:53.870
the current amount and terms

00:00:53.870 --> 00:00:55.320
in the app before confirming.

00:00:55.680 --> 00:00:56.700
There's no purchase

00:00:56.700 --> 00:00:57.940
required for this lesson.

00:00:57.940 --> 00:00:59.550
On a dealer account,

00:00:59.690 --> 00:01:00.790
ask your manager

00:01:00.790 --> 00:01:02.070
about billing or limits.

00:01:02.150 --> 00:01:03.730
On an individual account,

00:01:03.870 --> 00:01:05.370
contact the AutoLander

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:06.710
admin if the plan information

00:01:06.710 --> 00:01:07.730
needs clarification.

00:01:08.090 --> 00:01:09.350
For practice,

00:01:09.410 --> 00:01:10.850
explain the difference between

00:01:10.850 --> 00:01:12.920
posts remaining and AI credits,

00:01:12.920 --> 00:01:13.940
and find where

00:01:13.940 --> 00:01:14.960
you would check each.
